", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "OnePlus puts a cooling fan inside the Ace 7 to keep gamers at 185 frames", "title_zh": "一加把风扇塞进Ace 7，185帧游戏不烫手", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "mydrivers_ev", "source_url": "https://news.mydrivers.com/1/1163/1163909.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600373633615-9b045feaa299?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8cHJvJTIwYWNlJTIwbWFofGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQyODIxOTB8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Badhan Ganesh on Unsplash", "author": "Badhan Ganesh", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@badhanganesh?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/ace-of-spade-playing-card-wYFYDP9r8BY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(28, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(66, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "5044abb86628"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-10", "word_count": 264, "reading_minutes": 1.3, "lead": "OnePlus has fitted an active cooling fan into its new Ace 7, a standard-edition phone that borrows heavily from its Pro sibling. Alongside a 185Hz display and a 9000mAh battery, the handset is aimed squarely at people who play mobile games for hours on end.", "lead_zh": "一加在新款 Ace 7 里装上了主动散热风扇，这款标准版机型大量沿用 Pro 版本的配置。再加上 185Hz 屏幕和 9000mAh 电池，这台手机明显是冲着长时间玩手游的用户来的。", "preview": "The Ace line has always pursued a single goal: squeezing the utmost gaming performance out of a phone. With the Ace 7, OnePlus takes a bolde", "preview_zh": "Ace 系列一直只盯着一个目标：把手机的游戏性能榨到极致。到了 Ace 7，一加更进一步，直接把风扇装进机身，再配上两条专用风道，组成官方所称的双路冰河散热系统。一条风道对着芯片，另一条对着手握的位置，这样性能能稳住，长时间横屏打游戏时手感也不至于发烫。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 905, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 109.775, "size_bytes": 659664, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count"